### Configure a room [POST /room/config]

Configures the game settings for a multiplayer room and optionally starts the game.

+ Request (application/json)
    + Attributes (object)
        + allowDuplicates: `false` (boolean, required) - Whether the secret combination may contain duplicate digits.
        + start: `true` (boolean, required) - Starts the game after applying the settings.

+ Response 200

+ Response 400 (text/plain)

        Invalid data

+ Response 500 (text/plain)

        Room error occurred